{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-15T07:37:25.589Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"489731d8ab76ae02b28618d0","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1336","claim:pm-gh1724","lineage:pm-gh1336","lineage:pm-szv11n","lineage:pm-dj98","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1336+pm-gh1724","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1336","claim:pm-gh1724","lineage:pm-gh1336","lineage:pm-szv11n","lineage:pm-dj98","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.325","source":"probe"}},"op":"tests_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-15T07:37:25.589Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tests","value":[{"command":"node scripts/run-tests.mjs test tests/unit/commands/lifecycle/claim-stale-takeover.spec.ts tests/unit/sdk/ownership-activity.spec.ts tests/unit/cli/error-guidance.spec.ts tests/unit/commands/query/next-command.spec.ts tests/unit/commands/lifecycle/claim-command.spec.ts","scope":"project","timeout_seconds":600,"provenance":{"author":"harness:claude-code","created_at":"2026-11-15T07:37:25.503Z","source_kind":"local_mutation","source_ref":"feat/stale-work-visibility-and-takeover"}}]}],"before_hash":"67966497c007eae15539c872236dbe2f50d16beae0bff73732e50a7e82262553","after_hash":"a24f0cbf2a1dc3e545719c1fec55cf2a9d7a0c4d82524c9f2287156e342feace","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"maintenance","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"39a7860edc524bce6b2ab1561a39ce039133411021b1f951ad6a85378c5eaeed"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-15T07:37:48.377Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"489731d8ab76ae02b28618d0","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1336","claim:pm-gh1724","lineage:pm-gh1336","lineage:pm-szv11n","lineage:pm-dj98","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1336+pm-gh1724","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1336","claim:pm-gh1724","lineage:pm-gh1336","lineage:pm-szv11n","lineage:pm-dj98","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.325","source":"probe"}},"op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-15T07:37:48.377Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-15T07:37:48.377Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Implementation decisions (2026-11-15):\n\n- **Clock.** One activity clock: the newest of `updated_at` and the newest history entry. Every recorded mutation advances `updated_at`; I verified create, comment_add, note_add, files_add and claim on a sandbox. History covers trackers whose metadata and stream diverged. A claim with no valid activity time is never stale (fail-closed).\n- **Threshold.** The existing `mutation_guard.stale_in_progress_hours` (default 72), reused rather than adding a second knob. The item health calls stale is the item `--takeover-stale` may take.\n- **Race safety.** The decision runs inside the claim's `mutate` callback under the item lock. A holder's renewal is a mutation that has to wait for that lock, so it either lands before the decision (and is seen) or after the takeover.\n- **Evidence.** `mutateItemWithHistoryContextResolver` seals `context.stale_claim_takeover` into the same claim entry. The result carries the same receipt as `takeover`.\n- **Combinations.** `--takeover-stale` with `--force` and with `--next` are both refused (`ambiguous_option_combination`) before any read. `--if-available` turns an active-claim refusal into a skip.\n- **Ownership-source split.** `resolveItemOwnershipActivity` always returns activity, so the claim path carries no unreachable optional branches. `resolveItemOwnershipConflict` keeps its signature.\n- **pm next.** It reads one stream per returned `held_by_others` row (bounded by `--limit`), never per held item in the corpus. Bulk occupancy stays with pm-1wujzi."}]}],"before_hash":"a24f0cbf2a1dc3e545719c1fec55cf2a9d7a0c4d82524c9f2287156e342feace","after_hash":"f5c6e9b0db4da93eeb990e2508145f560ef82310024a56fd5b48f6bc2e6b1d6b","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"f2a15028af4b7536e24e5a9247d0c774b6f55ba7caa23cc0054548eaa7971287"}
